              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mu mwaka wa mirongo itanu n'irindwi Yehoyakini umwami w'Abayuda ari mu bunyage, mu kwezi kwa cumi n'abiri ku munsi wa makumyabiri n'irindwi wako, Evili Merodaki umwami w'i Babuloni mu mwaka wa mbere wo ku ngoma ye, asubiza Yehoyakini umwami w'Abayuda icyubahiro amuvana mu nzu y'imbohe. Ubwo hari mu mwaka yimyemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amubwirana ineza, yubahiriza intebe ye kuyirutisha iz'abandi bami bamubagaho i Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amukura mu myambaro y'imbohe amwambika imyiza, akajya asangira na we iminsi yose yo kubaho kwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami yamuhaga ibimutunga igerero rya buri munsi, iminsi yose yo kubaho kwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.30"
            ]
